    "Is KakobuyLab official, and does it sell products?":"¿KakobuyLab es oficial y vende productos?","No. KakobuyLab is an independent research and discovery site created to organize product links and explain the buying workflow. Product links lead to KakobuyMake, while order completion and final policies belong to Kakobuy. We do not take product or shipping payments.":"No. KakobuyLab es un sitio independiente de investigación. Los enlaces llevan a KakobuyMake; pedidos y políticas pertenecen a Kakobuy. No cobramos productos ni envíos.",
    "Found the right link?":"¿Encontraste el enlace correcto?","Open Kakobuy, confirm the live listing, and keep the QC checklist nearby.":"Abre Kakobuy, confirma el anuncio y usa la lista QC.","Continue on Kakobuy ↗":"Continuar en Kakobuy ↗",
